# Carlo Gavazzi EM24-IS.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Carlo Gavazzi EM24-IS — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: carlo-gavazzi-em24-is-modbus.pdf
# | - 3-phase 4-wire DIN-rail energy analyzer (isolated input), RS485.
# | - Holding registers (FC03) — FC03 and FC04 are interchangeable on this device.
# | - INT32 little-endian (LSW first), INT16 for PF and Hz.
# | - All addresses are 0-based protocol addresses (Modicon address − 300001).
# | - No per-phase power registers; only voltages, currents, PF, Hz, energy.
# | - Scales: V×0.1, A×0.001, PF×0.001, Hz×0.1, kWh×0.1.
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, baud=4800 or 9600, 8N1.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Carlo Gavazzi
@model=EM24-IS
@vendor_website=gavazziautomation.com
@description=3-phase 4-wire isolated-input DIN-rail energy analyzer — per-phase V/I, avg V, total PF, Hz, import energy (INT32 LSW-first, INT16 for PF/Hz, holding registers).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/carlo-gavazzi-em24-is.toml; Source: carlo-gavazzi-em24-is-modbus.pdf. Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

